		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>recount in detail</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀτοπίαν σου</span>”
